Drop the production 80x80 RGBA PNG here, named `icon.png`.

LG QA rejects icons that:
  - are not exactly 80x80
  - have a transparent background (LG renders icons on a glass tile; full
    opacity reads better)
  - use the iconColor (#FF3B6E) as the primary mass (LG composites that
    color behind the icon — duplicate-coloring kills contrast)
  - include the word "TV" (their style guide forbids it for app icons)
